- Good: "Park|🏞️|child_in_playground|Let's go to the park" (🏞️ is vague, imageKey adds clarity)


### CUSTOM ICONS
Custom symbols (use symbol:ID as icon in place of emoji).
When using custom symbols, omit imageKey.
