Gal is 6 years old and communicates via AAC. He has strong preferences for interactive, hands-on activities—especially drawing, music, and interactive apps. His core interests include facts, drawing, music, science (hands-on exploration: experiments, how things work, chemistry, weather), farm games, space topics (stars, moon, planets, rockets, astronauts), and programming (Code blocks, Games, Robots).

